  "validation": "Eight paired source builds through tape-run endpoint pass; 73 common public/generated type and axiom reports, five surviving private reports, Btape endpoint and 29,339 global simp entries match. Ten cached direct occurrences match prior source/object records; eight fresh reprobes pin their direct inputs.",
  "limitations": [
    "Upstream transitive objects, Foundation and package inputs remain cached; this is not a full clean closure.",
    "Eight private names disappear and five public/generated names appear, including two newly public helpers and a new generated source_breakB._simp_1; global simp membership is unchanged.",
    "Earlier broader reference searches were truncated or terminated; the subsequent no-reference claim is limited to the project Lean tree. Earlier probes lacked direct-import hashes and are superseded by pinned reprobes.",
    "Compiled objects and the original replay environment are excluded."
  ],
